  {
   "id": "kreaturekind-152194@1.1.01",
   "gameId": "kreaturekind-152194",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.01",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-04T11:45:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Changes in this version are mostly ficused on UX, and include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The possible targets for each card has been made a little more clear, with additional arrows and (X) over unavailable characters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The currently selected card is now a bit more clear, with an arrow pointing at it. This is especially useful when playing with a controller!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The prompt to select a target when you have chosen a card is anow a little more clear",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Settings menu should now be easier to navigate with a controller",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Legend can now only be opened in relevant menus, as to not be confusing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can no longer open the Plushie assignment panel with a controller before you have any, as to be less confusing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The functionality of Prep has been made a little more clear (new icon, honing object) - however I intend to keep working on this",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What should I focus on next? LMK!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "/A",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
